                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='28'>.</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>This long range tracking report is based on a statistical safety stock calculation based on variation in demand and supplier lead time, as also defined in this statistical-current-snapshot report</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#d1d2d3' fontsize='12'> :</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#d1d2d3' fontname='Slack-Lato,appleLogo,sans-serif' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Æ </run>
                    <run auto-url='true' bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/#/site/GlobalStandardReporting/views/DarkStores-OverstockingReportStatisticalMethod_16243562393990/Definitions?:iid=2&amp;quot;'>https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/#/site/GlobalStandardReporting/views/DarkStores-OverstockingReportStatisticalMethod_16243562393990/Definitions?:iid=2</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='28'>.</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>In current report/view, only SKUs older than 30 days in the store and having 100% Availability in last 28 days in Stores older than 3 months are reported</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='28'>.</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Daily snapshots of last 1 year are stored and presented in current report for access/viewing with different geographic and time granularities to track progress</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='28'>.</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Any new stores maturing over the considered time horizon to more than 3 months of age and any new SKUs maturing over the considered time horizon to more than 30 days of age are considered in this report</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Store Transfer Related:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Store Transfers</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> - How many ST were originated there</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Store Transfer SKUs</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> - Total ST SKU count at origin warehouse</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Avg. SKUs/ST</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> - Avg SKU count per ST at origin warehouse</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Avg. Items/SKU/ST</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> - Avg SKU Quantity per SKU per ST at origin warehouse</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Avg. ST Time (h)</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> - Avg Time taken per ST at destination warehouse </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>ST Time (h) / SKU</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> - Avg ST Time taken per SKU at destination warehouse </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Stale SKUs</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> - Non listed skus, this is a subset of active SKUs.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>SKU age</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> - difference between earliest receipt date(first inbound of SKU in store) and date of report (today)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Warehouse age</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'><![CDATA[ - age of warehouse since store is live, because we do not want to focus on new stores that are < 3 months old, as they still need time for sales(market) to develop.]]></run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{D28240C2-6849-4459-A7D3-F7568C312E9B}' />
    </dashboard>
